#: scenario3:scenario3_14DC029D_6F9B_49C6_ABBB_63AC9DE30A9D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4ebc3ebf4995b7c957939aafc4cc152fa3c55e790ad29bdde73d2f531c049010
#. default-sha256: ee1be62b4359a8cad008d4a4757532c8dff83305db6118b9dd951ecc999730a8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_14DC029D_6F9B_49C6_ABBB_63AC9DE30A9D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫The White-Haired Girl’s persistent letters did not "
"improve anything—⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫but simply stoked the flames of misunderstanding."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫何通も書かれる手紙は、⟪k:8⟫事態を好転させるどころか、⟪k:9⟫"
"誤解を助長させていくばかり……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_0230BE86_680D_4245_A157_96799FD22D51
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1f36d6d387e668610f2a4757fd64dc95d8ed306ea7656ceb5bdd82f81e7f24de
#. default-sha256: 437b1caa300c15cfe377a4c9ffe0e1ade12e0b9e4fbf5f9712bec858806e36bd
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0230BE86_680D_4245_A157_96799FD22D51"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This continued for several months. ⟪k:1⟫Though outside, the sun shone with the gentle warmth "
"of spring, the cold, bitter winds of winter still relentlessly blew between Jacopo and his wife."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫そんな日々が、⟪k:1⟫数か月ほど過ぎました。⟪k:2⟫やがてうららかな日差しが心地よい、⟪k:3⟫春となり"
"ましたが、⟪k:4⟫二人の関係は相変わらず極寒の最中。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D9FE6E02_E421_4202_B548_271051E2306F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db9b80667ef5a426e6de6c2fe186a252f339534c6679384b757e1a14ad09252a
#. default-sha256: f8dad59d5df7619a388c107ccd087b616d63d90bd0a15dc68119229d676faef1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D9FE6E02_E421_4202_B548_271051E2306F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not allowed to leave her shed and never receiving a reply to her letters, the White-Haired "
"Girl’s only source of information was Maria."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫外に出ることも出来ず――手紙を書いても返事は来ず。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫彼女に向けられる現実は、⟪k:3⟫マリー"
"アからの言葉のみ。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9295EFCA_DFA1_49EC_BEA6_19A4B3F31568
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d89fa8aeb114c3a2d2e2225c92596297bd1d0e0f6b5affcb635c3f6c0104f018
#. default-sha256: 5a916ede345cfc65d98394d373962e5811bcc3acbe5f578308b32da4f4df4e54
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9295EFCA_DFA1_49EC_BEA6_19A4B3F31568"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Week after week, her circumstances remained the same, but something else was beginning to "
"show signs of change:"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そんな日々を繰り返す中で、⟪k:1⟫異変もあったのです。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4A531797_C484_4ED8_99AD_E9EF3E48E268
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 741cc1c69892808fbe4d826b963e2562c19c5b5a8536b6ee39294f37896d45f2
#. default-sha256: 95b1dec0a5a4a16ce60e5527fedcee84f130ed6e537e8aeaa4801564fb9377fc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4A531797_C484_4ED8_99AD_E9EF3E48E268"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Her mental state."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そう――、⟪k:1⟫娘の心にです。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3AFF6045_6BD0_4728_B88A_C236A237AF98
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f99682db2af114942abebc320a18c172a738681c0b1812480cad3538c8a82f4
#. default-sha256: 8e8746d805423bd7a765159f4daa265981f4a0bac4d161b472cfab3b27e8e1e5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3AFF6045_6BD0_4728_B88A_C236A237AF98"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫It’s pointless, Madam.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫You’re only wasting "
"your time at this point."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫奥さま――、⟪k:9⟫もうムリだよ。⟪k:10⟫これ以上やっても、"
"⟪k:11⟫無意味だよ。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_94B1DBAC_9630_4BC1_9E09_AA36E5ED66AD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5547064643c196a01b7573039d72403d891cce9852ef65204495b6ce982e5f1b
#. default-sha256: ec7a6224dbf2ae0b3cd2ba4fc32dd3682a42cac47988b72bbc84f81e8d6a5dd6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_94B1DBAC_9630_4BC1_9E09_AA36E5ED66AD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I saw him throw your letter into the fireplace."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫あたし、⟪k:3⟫見たんだ。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫あいつが――奥さまの手紙を、⟪k:6⟫暖炉に捨てちまうと"
"ころ……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7D2C7799_850B_45F7_9E6A_E0B1EB0FCD9F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 068f8561c24e4e4cba1813ab86020a3e95527ff39e05ddb19c7b837662485174
#. default-sha256: 8f3385b6293f39c3351dadc7eee986d997dd1ff785a3d74e0eefaa66b0978e70
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7D2C7799_850B_45F7_9E6A_E0B1EB0FCD9F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He’s not going to read anything you write,⟪k:1⟫no matter how much of your soul you pour into "
"it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫もう、⟪k:1⟫見てもくれないんだよ。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫奥さまがどんなに心を込めて手紙を書いたって。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_398852CA_FECB_4B42_9AE6_2A98A8FAF0CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ae61f35a1bfdf8c1bc3608b8e7aecafe83b2eb3c36a0bcfa89cd45ceac8e353c
#. default-sha256: f4669dc5d802893d859c86679c36d1a94a2378374e9af0c1c5c9e554292cfaed
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_398852CA_FECB_4B42_9AE6_2A98A8FAF0CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He cares more about money and work than love.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That’s the kind of man he is."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫あいつは人に対する愛よりも、⟪k:1⟫金と仕事が好きなんだ。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫そういう男なんだよ。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9BE94E12_B9CD_4744_B4A9_8539814B0F6E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 36f24057b73c5a19055e5b853b3a7ed6dedef2bb72bb5a8fe89b24179347c50b
#. default-sha256: 9111397b831fbc6eb9e41380de0387abdf3ca194ab0ed08809c7d4c58e46f31f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9BE94E12_B9CD_4744_B4A9_8539814B0F6E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Just give up and file for divorce already."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫もう諦めて、⟪k:1⟫離婚を叩きつけたらいいじゃんか。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A91AFD46_E069_4D31_87C9_0F5F3C8AA71E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f70bb3551c8cb060666723cf33a4d297f5c6620a6569ab3729def076fe87b89a
#. default-sha256: abf36fa3095a8c6e2b215ca32782e42b4cb82958e631b3496fac57d2531b11bb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A91AFD46_E069_4D31_87C9_0F5F3C8AA71E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫................................."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……………………………。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C7CD7239_02F4_40D9_9FA5_DCA92B72EDF5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01f06ff4b13e75ae622320a4febd4b20d058c984e641f30a577e9b4fdfcfcca3
#. default-sha256: c5ef2af73533e03c70df48e6e19b5b57bb0e14ff1f49ddab11b46f821c3f28e7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C7CD7239_02F4_40D9_9FA5_DCA92B72EDF5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫No... ⟪k:2⟫No..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……いいえ……、⟪k:2⟫いいえ……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A174DBE2_8F2C_464A_9A01_1E9AEBCE5D74
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 51ab1c142f60e7d6ee74084c699374f05fb3cd52b93ce50f88a25aaf2b46ca73
#. default-sha256: fb4d5e8afeea30e3d48530c345bb6e6ea1126148a86c06c83ffabc532083038f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A174DBE2_8F2C_464A_9A01_1E9AEBCE5D74"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I will get through to him...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Everything will go back to normal...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I have "
"faith."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫いつか……届くと……。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫すべて、⟪k:3⟫元に戻ると……信じて、⟪k:4⟫いますから。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_434D9104_934D_4D9E_876C_33E647912E0F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 75cd847dfc256cd8f443d23c620ee500c497556ffcd9c90286ec853329087d58
#. default-sha256: 0f5e37f231ecdb47cdc292ca4c8e801090ce2aec84e92a69ec5a15739af8c220
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_434D9104_934D_4D9E_876C_33E647912E0F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫All my letters may go up in flames...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but my faith will not be lost with them."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫例え手紙が燃え尽きたとしても……、⟪k:1⟫私があの人を信じる気持ちまでは、⟪k:2⟫失われないんです。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B91FF130_107B_4C5D_91A5_56B2E0FC1501
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0fa006528449adb4923819bb3168aec3a19e49b36f2e47fa5f477527c98c7fc7
#. default-sha256: f05310fc0d2e73a5d9860ec836420d433246bf0f877f2d7ac94cd50bf20f7bc2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B91FF130_107B_4C5D_91A5_56B2E0FC1501"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫As long as I keep writing..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫書きつづければ、⟪k:1⟫きっと……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_FF9E4CFF_D915_4518_9A03_681D65EB23E6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ad37ea08ba4f3abfd774a9ca6d521eece637176b0a02da3af1b4d87235ee615
#. default-sha256: 6dd0dcbb2d348ece60f292f94641f55949d14bad0088d4e6a721282e960a9421
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FF9E4CFF_D915_4518_9A03_681D65EB23E6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫eventually... ⟪k:1⟫I will get through to him.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫So I cannot stop... ⟪k:4⟫I cannot."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫届きます……届くはずなんです。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫だから、⟪k:3⟫止めることなんて出来ない……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_FC66C310_D0EC_4D7A_B6E2_D7C0006192FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b150e679d5007c67fa3dd2ef3203d497bf91d107f7f716ff2fa59f7ae12f29d
#. default-sha256: e2ef55e221791337b198ef0414890158d8dbce266f0257557cfb4bb3affbdaec
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FC66C310_D0EC_4D7A_B6E2_D7C0006192FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Do you have any idea what he says about you, Madam?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……あいつが、⟪k:2⟫奥さまのこと……何て言ってるか、⟪k:3⟫知ってる？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F01194CA_4BA1_4927_8D9B_8AFBA294025E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 170362638609509945ce375be2a595cfe51023c51ea795b844bcc54cb7da2ce9
#. default-sha256: d570a87ac64e27792617c330700d19bc580c3aa6d1be9206c4e9ce93bf46452a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F01194CA_4BA1_4927_8D9B_8AFBA294025E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_1546908A_4815_49FB_8144_C6A5F7BDE298
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8097e1bc8832c646d08b8675037285c9ef881635d23eee499317c931b8c11d38
#. default-sha256: aded4b64cf42d74e178edb44134d1e53952f3f98c0d1b9e4f4955f02df786630
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1546908A_4815_49FB_8144_C6A5F7BDE298"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Jacopo doesn’t trust you in the ⟪k:2⟫slightest⟪k:3⟫.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫He goes around calling "
"you a witch.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫A man-eating devil-woman."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫疑心暗鬼の塊なんだよ。⟪k:2⟫奥さまのこと、⟪k:3⟫魔女呼ばわりしてるんだ。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫男を誑か"
"すような悪魔だって……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3B0F9553_40AB_4C08_9C9A_29FEF480ED2C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f88b16094e5c527df3ab3d8de060b3509937c41ebed773b808ed8d376f21ffb7
#. default-sha256: 571525c6fd0a36b49148804f214c2d3d666b2fb6324c3cf403a9a541787c680d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3B0F9553_40AB_4C08_9C9A_29FEF480ED2C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It’s awful.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫There’s no one as pure and as beautiful as you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ひどい話だよ。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫奥さまみたいに美しくて、⟪k:4⟫清らかな人はいないっていうのに。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_31FA80D5_12A8_4254_B2D4_55D8CD3D7FC9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 85ab9ee0c037ae6dd395fe1353c4aaebf7eb307d50287b6f94fe8806b053aa44
#. default-sha256: 7df5146491ddf4f8f27ac9cc6c9b94b012bb7992242bdcdce68b06433c8b4879
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_31FA80D5_12A8_4254_B2D4_55D8CD3D7FC9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫He says... ⟪k:2⟫I am a witch?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫私が……魔女……⟪k:2⟫ですか。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_2938A9B9_A728_4CA9_8E74_A87E86F07571
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc23344ae495ad02d8475cea62f4bc955b98aadec7c5e9c51020a7cb1f60e0de
#. default-sha256: 98483c336dda050eb38a5427c84bcb5e0e53a58b18c87ae16aeb00251cb29b7e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2938A9B9_A728_4CA9_8E74_A87E86F07571"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Listen to me, Madam.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫He never for a second ⟪k:4⟫actually⟪k:5⟫ loved you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫奥さま――、⟪k:2⟫あいつは最初っから、⟪k:3⟫あなたのことを愛してなんかいなかったんだよ。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7E310359_F5BE_44B4_AE3C_7F377E807B21
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b8b59f1cc0a3e58da1d7e0c3a640a35aa2ab847f428193a7ab339902ff6578cc
#. default-sha256: 536d1c2957315e68e0ae23d380e055d4ca116dff91d61a846b55c8912064f1e5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7E310359_F5BE_44B4_AE3C_7F377E807B21"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He just wanted the influence attached to your name.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Wanted to mingle with the upper "
"class."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫名家という権力が欲しくて――ただそれだけで。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫社交界に行きたくて、⟪k:3⟫それだけで。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5997B74F_8DC7_4A29_B3D7_CE1F29A03E03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5198fe85d1e2904b6300baa44f340fa634373cdfb8b74e0b46f129c6ea090755
#. default-sha256: 971a6aa18df6dae62b38a4e92bf3fd992f0a2aef1df458981bc040b7750064d8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5997B74F_8DC7_4A29_B3D7_CE1F29A03E03"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He ⟪k:1⟫used⟪k:2⟫ you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫奥さまを利用したんだ。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4FE46BE7_958C_4C8C_B141_10A50D9C9847
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 549e32397cf05d093ea5950aeeb9e2ace3dfc92b2634e426bc46f4a25abd13e9
#. default-sha256: 100a08d92a85f7a515d9502bc7be7f0d2b87f80dfe889e162feed30011f6375e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4FE46BE7_958C_4C8C_B141_10A50D9C9847"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But last year... ⟪k:2⟫when we went out together..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……でも……、⟪k:2⟫一年前、⟪k:3⟫一緒に出掛けたとき……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3AFE7A7E_D651_4FF5_B9AC_78B8BC3B1DFC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
